WEBVTT

07:31.352 --> 07:33.604
(YELPS)

07:33.730 --> 07:35.898
(WHIMPERS) I yield.

07:36.024 --> 07:38.526
- Please, no more.
- On your feet.

07:38.651 --> 07:40.820
Pick up your sword.

07:40.945 --> 07:43.573
Hit him till he finds his feet.

07:44.240 --> 07:46.451
(SAMWELL YELPING)

07:50.997 --> 07:52.874
(WHIMPERING)

07:52.999 --> 07:55.626
It seems they've run short
of poachers and thieves down south.

07:55.752 --> 07:58.463
- Now they send us squealing bloody pigs.
- Jon!

07:58.588 --> 08:00.882
- Again, harder.
- (GROWNS)
